translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Enter_341b6f71:

    # yu "What is this place, it's so... different from the rest of the forest."
    yu "这里是什么地方，怎么……和森林的其他地方如此不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Enter_8b98d6fd:

    # "You feel a sense of unease, as if even the trees are watching you. Perhaps you should go back and stay at the tower."
    "你感到一阵不安，仿佛连树木都在注视着你。也许你该回去，待在高塔里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Enter_17484c67:

    # "But something inside you tells you a secret lies in here."
    "但你心底的某个声音告诉你，这里面藏着一个秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_e16f6d3c:

    # "You see a faint marking on the ground, it shows a hefty figure with awry pair of arms."
    "你看见地面上有一道模糊的刻痕，描绘着一个身形魁梧、长着一对歪斜手臂的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_9dfdaf8b:

    # "You find a marking as you look down, with a floating figure of eight ephemeral arms."
    "你低头发现一道刻痕，描绘着一个拥有八条飘忽手臂的漂浮身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_69e69631:

    # "A symbol beneath the grass meets your eyes, it seems to be of a whimsical three-eyed construct."
    "草丛下的一个符号映入眼帘，似乎是某种异想天开的三眼构造体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_0c956d73:

    # "In the dirt, you find a marking of a crounching creature with a pair of sharp claws."
    "泥土里有一道刻痕，描绘着一只蜷伏的生物和一对锋利的爪子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_daa7d876:

    # "You find a marking of an abstract symbol, you can't make out what it depicts but at least it seems symmetrical."
    "你找到一个抽象符号的刻痕，看不出它描绘的是什么，但至少它看起来是对称的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_7c36222e:

    # "You find a marking of a creature of sophisticated structures, it seems to be related to some plants."
    "你发现一道刻痕，描绘着一个结构精巧的生物，似乎与某些植物有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_ea1eb81d:

    # "There is a symbol on the ground, perhaps of an antlered man with musical notes on the side."
    "地面上有一个符号，也许描绘的是一个长着鹿角、身旁还刻着音符的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_a3658ef6:

    # "A marking of a creature with a large horn is on the ground, it seems to be restrained in some form."
    "地面上刻着一个长着巨角的生物，似乎以某种方式被束缚着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_63fe74ba:

    # "From the ground, you see a symbol of a spherical form like the sun, emanating rays and cresant shapes."
    "你从地面上看见一个类似太阳的球形符号，向外散发着光芒和新月形图案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_fae3e1d8:

    # "Scratching off the dirt, there is fluttering symbol of wings and shapes beneath it, if you have not mistaken it."
    "你刮开泥土，下面似乎有一个由翅膀和各种形状组成的飘动符号，如果你没看错的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_ed367216:

    # "You notice a symbol of a flying creature with two long arms, seemingly soaring over the forest."
    "你注意到一个长着两条长臂的飞行生物符号，仿佛正翱翔于森林上空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_da9b238a:

    # "Incidentally, a small, dark symbol is etched on the ground, perhaps it depicts a whirlwind of some sort."
    "你无意间发现地面刻着一个小小的黑色符号，也许描绘的是某种旋风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_41252d3f:

    # "On the ground, you take notice of an egg-shaped altar, with a small hole on the top."
    "你注意到地面上有一座蛋形祭坛，顶部开着一个小孔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_1288da05:

    # "Some words are etched on the surface, albeit blurred, you can only make out one word - 'Offering-'."
    "表面刻着一些文字，虽然已经模糊不清，你只能辨认出一个词——“供奉-”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_ea0fc3d3:

    # "You can't help but feel a sense of familiarity with it, as if you have seen it before."
    "你不禁感到一阵熟悉，仿佛以前在哪里见过它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_25b9c2e1:

    # "Looking closely, you discover 5 holes on the altar, maybe something can be done with it..."
    "仔细一看，你发现祭坛上有5个孔，也许可以对它做些什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_c98f1cc1:

    # "Looking closely, you discover 5 holes on the altar, [bone_num] of which has been filled."
    "仔细一看，你发现祭坛上有5个孔，其中有[bone_num]个已经填满。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_1a3db160:

    # "An ordinary stone, maybe you can lift it up if you have the strength."
    "一块普通的石头，也许你有足够力气的话，可以把它举起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_4aae124e:

    # "A sword embedded within the rocky ground beneath the surface, you can't seem to pull it out with whatever strength you have."
    "地表下的岩地里嵌着一把剑，无论你使出多大力气，似乎都拔不出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_6e2d6d2b:

    # "A strange, dragon-like skull. It's somewhat smaller than the folks back in your tribe."
    "一颗奇怪的龙形头骨。它比你部落里的族人要小一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_17259bc1:

    # "Staring at it, you can't help but to shiver, a shred of doubt plants its seed in your mind, you have to reassure yourself, it must not be Chime's..."
    "盯着它看时，你不禁打了个寒颤，一丝怀疑在心底发芽；你必须说服自己，那一定不是 Chime 的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_c5f2c958:

    # "Giving another glance, you notice a bone token inside the skull."
    "再看了一眼，你注意到头骨里面有一枚骨质令牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_4a0da2eb:

    # "You pick them up carefully, scraping off the dust on the bone before carrying on."
    "你小心地把它们捡起来，刮去骨头上的灰尘，然后继续前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_9b40d500:

    # "There's a bone token inside, but you can't carry more."
    "里面有一枚骨质令牌，但你已经无法再携带更多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_7e8b88d2:

    # "You take notice of a small board lodged on the ground, and some stone tiles placed on the surface."
    "你注意到地面上嵌着一块小木板，表面还摆着几块石砖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_f2189a77:

    # "Three mysterious symbols are etched around the squares on the board, perhaps they are something from around the forest."
    "木板上的方格周围刻着三个神秘符号，也许它们来自森林的某处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_59f2a42e:

    # "A click sound can be heard from within the stone board, as the four tiles suddenly becomes wedged in the slots."
    "石板内部传来咔哒一声，四块石砖突然卡进了槽位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_2ca27f2c:

    # "Now the board seems to be glowing faintly, before you see the gate ahead silently opens."
    "现在木板似乎在微微发光，随后你看见前方的大门悄无声息地打开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_212e391c:

    # "A cluster of weathered pots strewn haphazardly on the forest floor."
    "一堆风吹日晒的罐子杂乱地散落在森林地面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_8b378243:

    # "Upon closer inspection, you notice a subtle warmth emanating from the pots."
    "仔细观察后，你注意到罐子正散发出一丝微弱的暖意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_48ea6145:

    # "You pick one up and find a bone token inside, and take it with you."
    "你拿起一个，发现里面有一枚骨质令牌，便把它带在身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_9b40d500_1:

    # "There's a bone token inside, but you can't carry more."
    "里面有一枚骨质令牌，但你已经无法再携带更多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_baeb6be2:

    # "You found a few loose pages resting underneath the journal."
    "你发现日志下面压着几张散落的纸页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_818887b1:

    # "Flipping through the pages, it seems to be about something called spritebinder."
    "翻过几页后，你发现内容似乎与一种叫作 spritebinder 的东西有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_69a255ab:

    # yu "Pekoe...? It sounds so familiar, like I've heard of it before..."
    yu "Pekoe……？这个名字听起来好熟悉，就像我以前听说过一样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_da715dba:

    # "The fact that it was hidden in the forest makes you nervous. So you decide to keep your knowledge and put the notes back."
    "它被藏在森林里的事实让你感到不安。因此，你决定把这件事记在心里，并将笔记放回原处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_15b5d845:

    # "The four tiles seem to be wedged in the slots of the board."
    "四块石砖似乎卡在木板的槽位里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_2c733cb1:

    # "A collection of ethereal candles flicker, casting a soft glow in the eerie forest."
    "一簇幽灵般的蜡烛摇曳着，在阴森的森林中投下柔和的光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_d86ab969:

    # "You feel somewhat uncomfortable, after all there should be no one around to light these candles."
    "你感到有些不舒服，毕竟周围应该没有人会来点燃这些蜡烛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_655b7496:

    # "A large, heavy block of stone, it doesn't look like anything you've seen before."
    "一块巨大而沉重的石块，看起来不像你以前见过的任何东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_cfc5a96c:

    # "The statue of a familiar dragon bear weathered expressions of accomplishment."
    "那座熟悉的龙雕像带着饱经风霜、却满是成就感的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_7057c534:

    # "It appears to bear intricate carvings and faint runes that shimmer when touched."
    "它身上似乎有精细的雕刻和微弱的符文，触碰时会闪烁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_8848c281:

    # "Upon closer inspection, you notice the word {i}'Pekoe'{/i} carved on the base of the statue."
    "仔细一看，你注意到雕像底座上刻着 {i}'Pekoe'{/i} 这个词。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_58efcf17:

    # "A large, hollowed trunk, it seems to be a good place to store things."
    "一根被掏空的大树干，看起来是储存东西的好地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_2491c19c:

    # "Opening the trunk reveals nothing more than a few fallen leaves and the faint scent of damp earth."
    "打开树干后，里面除了几片落叶和一丝潮湿泥土的气味，什么也没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_04102bdf:

    # "As you approach the lone barrel, a subtle aroma wafts through the air, perhaps a blend of earthy moss and distant enchantments."
    "当你靠近那只孤零零的木桶时，一缕若有若无的气味飘入空气，也许是潮湿苔藓与远方魔法气息的混合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_398a93ba:

    # "You can't drop the stone here."
    "你不能把石头丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_d235492a:

    # "You place the bone token into the hole on the egg-shaped altar."
    "你把骨质令牌放进蛋形祭坛上的孔里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_24f76e56:

    # "The token fits perfectly, and the altar glows faintly before going dim again."
    "令牌严丝合缝，祭坛微微发光，随后又重新暗了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_d235492a_1:

    # "You place the bone token into the hole on the egg-shaped altar."
    "你把骨质令牌放进蛋形祭坛上的孔里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_0e1a7ba7:

    # "The token fits perfectly, and the altar glows faintly."
    "令牌严丝合缝，祭坛微微发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_e7db83e4:

    # "The altar seems to be full now, and the glow becomes more apparent."
    "祭坛现在似乎已经装满了，光芒也变得更加明显。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Loop_b224f094:

    # "You can't drop the bone here."
    "你不能把骨头丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Spriteling_77faed7b:

    # "As you wander through the eerie forest, a soft glow materializes into a Spriteling."
    "你在阴森的森林中徘徊时，一团柔和的光逐渐凝聚成一个小精灵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Forest_Spriteling_6957c94d:

    # "You can feel the cold air around you, as the Spriteling's presence becomes more apparent."
    "你能感受到四周的寒气，那个小精灵的存在也变得越发明显。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_2d966d51:

    # yu "Huh?"
    yu "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_9c9e5503:

    # "The altar glows brighter and brighter, until the light becomes blinding."
    "祭坛越发明亮，直到光芒变得刺眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_42787eba:

    # "A loud, otherworldly sound echoes through the forest, and you feel a sudden gust of wind."
    "一阵响亮的异界声响在森林中回荡，你感到一阵突如其来的狂风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_ce9d0a03:

    # "When the light fades, you find yourself standing in front of a strange, ethereal figure."
    "光芒消退后，你发现自己站在一个奇异的幽灵般身影面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_bffdacf8:

    # "A hooded strange sprite, with too many pairs of arms, manifested itself before your eyes."
    "一个戴着兜帽、长着太多对手臂的怪异精灵出现在你眼前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_48b3d209:

    # yu "What is this thing!"
    yu "这是什么东西！"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_9fe2937b:

    # "It stares at you for a moment, before speaking in a voice that seems to come from everywhere at once."
    "它凝视了你片刻，随后开口说话；那声音仿佛同时来自四面八方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_73241cc5:

    # yu "Shit!"
    yu "该死！"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_433bad0c:

    # "Within a few seconds, it extends its arms towards you, and begins trying to grip onto you tightly."
    "几秒钟内，它伸出手臂朝你探来，开始试图紧紧抓住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Summoning_Spritebinder_5f9014d9:

    # "You yank them away, and prepares to fight against this unknown entity."
    "你猛地把那些手臂扯开，准备与这个未知的存在战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_89249e7f:

    # "You can hear the rustling of the leaves as hezzong strolls along the narrow trail, but his calmness doesn't relieve your anxiety."
    "你能听见树叶沙沙作响，Hezzong 正沿着狭窄的小径慢慢走着，但他的镇定并没能缓解你的焦虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_455f3f65:

    # "The lack of sleep is getting to you, you can feel your eyes getting heavier and heavier."
    "睡眠不足开始影响你，你能感觉到眼皮越来越沉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_9abc685c:

    # "Just as you are about to fall asleep, Hezzong stops in front of you."
    "就在你即将睡着时，Hezzong 停在了你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_d2137776:

    # hz "Here we are."
    hz "我们到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_0f9024f3:

    # "You blink a few times, before you can see a tall tower in front of you, with a few equipment scattered on the ground."
    "你眨了几下眼，才看见面前有一座高塔，地上散落着一些设备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_6a28971e:

    # hz "We've arrived to the post, you should be able to see the tribe on the top there."
    hz "我们到哨所了，你应该能看到上面那个部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_a1308b46:

    # hz "For a new watcher, we usually perform a quick formal training for a few weeks, but I don't think you need that."
    hz "对于新来的守望者，我们通常会进行几周的快速正式训练，但我觉得你不需要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_91520260:

    # hz "But as a formality, I will still try to explain how you can navigate around the forest."
    hz "不过为了走个形式，我还是会试着解释一下你该如何在森林中行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_d0dfb8d5:

    # yu "Allfather, I should just go now, I don't want to waste any more time."
    yu "至高父神，我现在就该走了，我不想再浪费时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_2ee7d570:

    # hz "Look, even though I wish to look the other way, you owe the tribe a due dilligence, considering I don't let anyone else use the duty as an excuse for travelling at night."
    hz "听着，虽然我也想睁一只眼闭一只眼，但考虑到我不允许其他人拿值勤当借口在夜间外出，你还是应该对部落尽到职责。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_b75cbfc8:

    # yu "Alright, I understand."
    yu "好，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_7ca85bea:

    # hz "Okay, let's begin then."
    hz "好，那我们开始吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_18a845c1:

    # "Hezzong walks up by your side, and begin explaining the basics of navigating in the forest."
    "Hezzong 走到你身旁，开始向你讲解在森林中行动的基础知识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_85172842:

    # hz "Now, try moving around the forest."
    hz "现在，试着在森林里移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Enter_bdad3f73:

    # msg "Hint: Try to use arrow Key, WASD or the arrow buttons on the screen to move."
    msg "提示：尝试使用方向键、WASD，或屏幕上的方向按钮来移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_7abc3451:

    # hz "Good, you are getting the hang of it."
    hz "很好，你已经掌握窍门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_d5f5bbb9:

    # yu "Okay, but I am just walking, I thought it's supposed to be easy."
    yu "好吧，但我只是在走路，我还以为应该很简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_db2e304e:

    # hz "How about this, get to the crates over there, and take a look at the food over there."
    hz "这样吧，去那边的木箱看看，再看看里面的食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_fa3d48b6:

    # msg "Hint: Try to use Space, or the Interact button on the screen to interact with objects."
    msg "提示：尝试使用空格键，或屏幕上的互动按钮与物体互动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_7f454ba1:

    # hz "Great, you're doing a good job."
    hz "很好，你做得不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_ffe2a7b6:

    # yu "I can see some turnips in the crate, what should I do with them?"
    yu "我看到箱子里有一些芜菁，我该拿它们怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_af04f851:

    # hz "Nothing, they are for the watchers, you can take them if you want."
    hz "什么也不用做，它们是给守望者的。你想拿就拿吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_9bdb2eeb:

    # hz "Now, try to pick up the turnips over there, and bring them into the crate."
    hz "现在，试着把那边的芜菁捡起来，放进箱子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_a08eae45:

    # msg "Hint: Try to use {i}E{/i}, or the hand button on the screen to pick up or drop objects."
    msg "提示: 尝试使用 {i}E{/i} 或屏幕上的手键来接收或丢弃对象。。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_ea8664ea:

    # hz "Well done..."
    hz "做得好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_79852122:

    # "Hezzong says as he yawns and stretches his furry arms outward lazily."
    "Hezzong 打着哈欠，懒洋洋地向外伸展着毛茸茸的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_fb824d49:

    # yu "Allfather, is this training enough?"
    yu "至高父神，这样训练够了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_36c3b4a0:

    # hz "I think you're ready as a watcher, at least for tonight."
    hz "我觉得你已经准备好当守望者了，至少今晚没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_07d3444a:

    # yu "Then, shall I go now?"
    yu "那我现在可以走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_278d3a51:

    # "Hezzong looks at you, and then at the tower."
    "Hezzong 看了看你，又看了看那座塔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_668bc42d:

    # hz "Yes, I am going back to the tribe to take my rest, maybe you should go up towards the watchtower."
    hz "是的，我要回部落休息了。也许你该上瞭望塔去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_4b2d830a:

    # hz "Don't walk too far away from the tower, unless you are ready to fight some sprites, or some fellow."
    hz "别离塔太远，除非你已经准备好和一些精灵，或者其他家伙战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_db25bbe3:

    # yu "Okay, but what if I see that light from Chime again? Should I run towards there?"
    yu "好吧,但如果我再看到齐门的灯光呢?"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_1fa8258c:

    # hz "No, it's too dangerous, you should strike the bell in our tower, and we'll be there swiftly and save him."
    hz "不，太危险了。你应该敲响我们塔上的钟，我们会迅速赶来救他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_551394c6:

    # hz "Even if we can't get a glimpse of Chime, at least we might save you from whatever's out there."
    hz "即使我们看不到 Chime，至少也许还能把你从外面的危险中救出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_8342fe29:

    # yu "I understand, Hezz."
    yu "我明白了，Hezz。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_d44c6c0b:

    # "The elder pats your shoulder tenderly as he leans slightly towards you."
    "长老向你微微倾身，温柔地拍了拍你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_e6dd3670:

    # hz "Well, stay safe and I'll see you tomorrow, good luck."
    hz "好，注意安全，明天见。祝你好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_8a07e2bf:

    # "Hezzong gives you another few pats, squeezing your shoulder with his short claws."
    "Hezzong 又拍了你几下，用他短短的爪子捏了捏你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_3ec95021:

    # "His snout curls into a smile, he is so close against your face, you can feel his warmth and the faint scent."
    "他的鼻吻弯成一个笑容，贴得离你的脸很近，你能感受到他的体温和淡淡的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_d833dd40:

    # "You take a heavy breath as Hezzong walks away, leaving you alone in the forest."
    "你深深吸了口气，Hezzong 转身离开，把你独自留在森林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_db91afaa:

    # yu "I guess I should look around the forest, or get on the tower."
    yu "我想我该在森林里四处看看，或者登上那座塔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_70489763:

    # yu "Should I head onto the tower right now? I'll probably stay there for the rest of the night." nointeract
    yu "我现在该上塔吗？我可能会在那里待一整晚。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_abe642f5:

    # hz "It's our watchtower, you should be able to see the tribe from the top over there."
    hz "那是我们的瞭望塔，你应该能从上面看到那边的部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_6ef6aeaa:

    # yu "Allfather, it's really tall."
    yu "至高父神，真高啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_c9e56bbb:

    # hz "We built it a long time ago, too long. It's a good place to see the entire forest."
    hz "我们很久以前就建好了，久远得不得了。那是俯瞰整片森林的好地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_5e0f0942:

    # hz "What are you doing over there? Our training is not over yet."
    hz "你在那边做什么？我们的训练还没结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_7f2a591e:

    # yu "Sorry! Allfather."
    yu "对不起！至高父神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_861eb58d:

    # "It seems to be a path leading deeper into the forest, you can't see the end of it, but you can see a faint light in the distance."
    "这似乎是一条通往森林深处的小路，你看不到尽头，但能看见远处有一丝微光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_398a93ba:

    # "You can't drop the stone here."
    "你不能把石头丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_1a3db160:

    # "An ordinary stone, maybe you can lift it up if you have the strength."
    "一块普通的石头，也许你有足够力气的话，可以把它举起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watch_Post_Loop_758c0011:

    # "You can't drop the turnip here."
    "你不能把芜菁丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_b33d9683:

    # k "You're back, are you prepared now."
    k "你回来了，现在准备好了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_c6f965f5:

    # k "I don't want to carry you out of the cave again."
    k "我可不想再把你从洞穴里背出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_239b9b42:

    # e "Yes, let's keep going."
    e "好，我们继续走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_38c18d0d:

    # k "I should have drafted my guards instead."
    k "我本来不该把我的卫兵调来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_0e185163:

    # e "H-hey, I'm a good fighter..."
    e "嘿、嘿，我很能打的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_40e45012:

    # "The general stays silent, staring at you blankly."
    "将军一言不发，面无表情地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_63b608f3:

    # e "I-I am!"
    e "我、我当然是！"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_0af21bee:

    # e "Alright, General."
    e "好的，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_9f919637:

    # k "You're back."
    k "你回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_d42aa91e:

    # e "Yes, let's continue with the cave."
    e "对，我们继续探索洞穴吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_40e45012_1:

    # "The general stays silent, staring at you blankly."
    "将军一言不发，面无表情地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_6d7f824b:

    # k "I shouldn't wait for you."
    k "我不该等你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_6ab0a3b3:

    # e "Look we can save Furkan together, alright?"
    e "我们可以一起救弗坎,好吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_9373df6d:

    # k "...if you go out one more time I'm going to kill you myself."
    k "……你要是再出去一次，我就亲手杀了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_0af21bee_1:

    # e "Alright, General."
    e "好的，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_ad2473e1:

    # k "I did not intend to come back after such a long time."
    k "我没想过时隔这么久还会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_ba6fd067:

    # e "Huh? Have you been here before?"
    e "嗯？你以前来过这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_0010b313:

    # k "So did Furkan, this place was an ancient research post for the origin of the flowing water."
    k "弗坎,这个地方是一个古老的研究站 研究流水的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_f6c42fbb:

    # k "Our guardians, the golems, were first created with the basin from here."
    k "我们的守护者——魔像，最初就是用这里的盆器创造出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_aba215cb:

    # e "Uh, what's a basin?"
    e "呃，盆器是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_ff324bbe:

    # k "Do you know nothing or what? A basin is a magical container, one that can hold the essence of the water."
    k "你什么都不知道吗？盆器是一种魔法容器，可以储存水的精华。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_dbace128:

    # e "Okay, you don't need to be mean about this. I am not from your tribe."
    e "好吧，你不用这么刻薄。我又不是你们部落的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_70545b86:

    # k "I'm not being mean, I'm just stating the fact."
    k "我不是在刻薄，只是在陈述事实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_e8e00549:

    # e "So, do you create guardians whenever you want?"
    e "所以，你们想什么时候创造守护者都行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_bf832a13:

    # k "No."
    k "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_c9cbff4c:

    # k "You need to have the right gemstone."
    k "你需要拥有正确的宝石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Enter_bf0a4e1a:

    # k "Stop bickering now, let's go find Furkan, he should be around somewhere."
    k "别再争了，我们去找 Furkan，他应该就在附近某处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_f78acfe3:

    # e "Furkan?"
    e "弗坎?"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_959a8787:

    # f "Yeah, I'm still here, waiting for the guards."
    f "是的，我还在这里等卫兵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_afa99a7b:

    # e "I should go to the Goat Tribe now."
    e "我现在该去山羊部落了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_ed7b2a19:

    # "Furkan seems to be unconscious."
    "弗坎似乎昏迷不醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_67435228:

    # k "Courier, He's right there!"
    k "信使，他就在那边！"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_2c2f1fc4:

    # e "Uhm? Oh... I see Furkan."
    e "嗯?我看见弗坎了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_e9859b0e:

    # k "Yes, let's get this over with, Courier."
    k "是的，信使，让我们赶紧结束这一切吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_24b6d42e:

    # k "Kill the Guardian."
    k "杀死守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_ceb7bdd4:

    # "You look at the Golem, who Kari told you was the rune guardian."
    "你看着那个魔像，Kari 告诉过你它就是符文守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_e499e5e0:

    # "Furkan was behind him, unconscious..."
    "弗坎在他身后 昏迷不醒..."

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_3575c89a:

    # "You look at the Guardian, it seems to be standing here..."
    "你看着那个守护者，它似乎就站在这里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_a0912840:

    # "There's an ordinary rock on the floor, Do you want to pick it up?"
    "地上有一块普通的石头，要捡起来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_43a91da1:

    # "There's a mossy rock on the floor, it seems to be glowing weakly in blue... Do you want to pick it up?"
    "地上有一块长满苔藓的石头，似乎在微弱地泛着蓝光……要捡起来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_54724ae6:

    # "There's a wooden plank on the floor, do you want to pick it up?"
    "地上有一块木板，要捡起来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_6c9bdec1:

    # "You can't take this here."
    "你不能在这里拿走这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_6c9bdec1_1:

    # "You can't take this here."
    "你不能在这里拿走这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_a920fd0e:

    # "You can't drop it here."
    "你不能把它丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_a920fd0e_1:

    # "You can't drop it here."
    "你不能把它丢在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_5183e1f6:

    # k "Wait, where are you going?"
    k "等等，你要去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_07824b1e:

    # e "I, need to get something..."
    e "我、我得去拿点东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_38d2e2f4:

    # k "But you can't leave me here."
    k "但你不能把我留在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_50401ba0:

    # k "Uhm."
    k "呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_48075da3:

    # k "Come back soon."
    k "快点回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_45d727e3:

    # e "A-alright. See you, General."
    e "好、好的。再见，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Loop_f291e002:

    # "You leave the dungeon through the exit tunnel, soon you reach the surface where you came from."
    "你通过出口隧道离开地牢，很快便回到了来时的地表。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Ward_9de74f29:

    # "You approach the stone ward in front of you, he doesn't seem to notice you."
    "你走近面前的石卫，它似乎没有注意到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Ward_56c30d3f:

    # "But he also doesn't move..."
    "但它也没有动……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Ward_f60aa64c:

    # "You jump in front of the stone ward, ready to battle with him."
    "你跳到石卫面前，准备和它战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_d67d40f0:

    # "You run into a chest in the cave, you walk towards it, trying to open the chest."
    "你在洞穴里撞见一只箱子，便走上前去，试图打开它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_e4a118d9:

    # "Suddenly the chest jumps right into your face, it's not a chest, it is a mimic."
    "箱子突然跳到你脸上；这不是箱子，而是一只拟态怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_384c5823:

    # "Mimic" "RAWAWWWR-"
    "嗷呜呜呜——" "RAWWWWWWWWWWW-"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_68fd897f:

    # "You scream, its tongue is slithering out, trying to latch on you..."
    "你尖叫起来，它的舌头蜿蜒伸出，试图缠住你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_2327a901:

    # k "W-what did you just do?"
    k "你、你刚才做了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_81773d81:

    # e "I d-don't know, let's kill it first!"
    e "我、我不知道，先把它干掉！"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Mimic_5ee4de31:

    # k "A-alright."
    k "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_b1d48a69:

    # "You discover the puddle in the front."
    "你发现前方有一滩水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_e6835a9f:

    # "It seems to glowing in blue light but the water is stagnant..."
    "它似乎泛着蓝光，但水已经死气沉沉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_c56c97f0:

    # "You drank the water, it seems to have healed you to full health."
    "你喝下了水，似乎已经恢复了全部生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_8bfbef95:

    # "But your Lust almost increased by 20."
    "但你的淫欲值差点增加了20点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_feb65ab0:

    # e "Uhm... that made me feel so hot right now."
    e "呃……我现在感觉好热。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_9b94ae94:

    # e "I drank the water."
    e "我喝了水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_7d2893ae:

    # k "You drank from a dirty puddle on the ground, are you stupid?"
    k "你喝的是地上的脏水坑，你是不是傻？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_7256839b:

    # e "Sorry..."
    e "对不起……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Puddle_d229b5e3:

    # "After drinking from the stagnant puddle, you decide to leave."
    "喝过死水坑里的水后，你决定离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_5a31dcf4:

    # e "Oh, there's a bookshelf here for some reason."
    e "哦，不知为何这里有个书架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_2a8468ee:

    # "As you are searching around the bookshelf, you found out that most of the books are all unreadable..."
    "你在书架附近搜寻时，发现大多数书都完全无法阅读……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_db731995:

    # "But after skimming through most of the shelf, there is a strip of paper that seems to be newer."
    "但你大致翻遍书架后，发现有一张纸条看起来比较新。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_73e13418:

    # k "Uhm, What did it say...?"
    k "呃，上面写了什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_ba0eff63:

    # e "Let me see."
    e "让我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_16401e07:

    # "You read from the paper..."
    "你读起了纸条上的内容……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_2651c84d:

    # "'T/e blessi/g of Tapj/o: Date/ Year 12/07...'"
    "‘塔普约的祝福：日/期 年/份 12/07……’"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_6442032d:

    # "'Accor/ding to the research by the King's a//isor, Kjarr Eli//.'"
    "‘根据国王顾问 Kjarr Eli// 的研/究。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_9594d69a:

    # "'The recent explosion near Kechi//ren ({i}Goat Tr/be/{/i}, seems to /e caused by an unkn//n magi/al force.'"
    "凯奇//伦附近最近发生的爆炸（{i}山羊部/落{/i}），似乎/由某种未//知的魔/力造成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_ad6f399b:

    # "'Thi/ force... o/ what the locals called {i}the Blessing of the Running Go/t{/i}. Has been speculated to contamin//e the water source.'"
    "‘这/种力量……当地人称之为{i}奔流山羊的祝福{/i}。据推测，它污染了水源。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_cc4fb772:

    # "'The aforement//ned water now appears to display a b/ight blue glow after the e//losion, while provi//ng heal/ng power to the drinker.'"
    "‘上述水源在爆/炸后似乎泛出明亮的蓝光，同时为饮用者提供治/愈之力。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_7ac33039:

    # "'It is /nknown if ther/ exists any possible side effect.'"
    "‘尚/不清楚是否存在任何副作用。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_c2ecef11:

    # "'For now, Goat Tri//'s Leader Goek/emir refused to cooperate with ou/ research team."
    "‘目前，山羊部落的首领 Goek/emir 拒绝与我/们的研究团队合作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_c6fa7ecc:

    # "The piece of paper gets cut off here."
    "纸条的内容到这里就中断了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_8c89c538:

    # e "Uhm... what a weird piece of information. Who actually writes like that."
    e "呃……这信息真奇怪。到底谁会这么写东西啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_97e6a665:

    # k "Is it talking about our Tribe?"
    k "它说的是我们的部落吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_5baea47a:

    # k "Goekdemir is Furkan's Great-Grandfather, at least they got it right."
    k "Goekdemir是弗坎的曾祖父 至少他们做得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_a0961606:

    # k "Otherwise, I consider it nothing but gibberish. You should do so as well."
    k "不然，我只会把它当成一派胡言。你也该这么看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_1b5a6720:

    # e "Oh... It is."
    e "哦……确实是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_0e98079c:

    # "You put the piece of paper back to the bookshelf."
    "你把纸条放回了书架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_63bd4eda:

    # "You also discovered a recipe for a plain bandana among the books."
    "你还在书里发现了普通头巾的制作配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_e246719a:

    # e "A plain bandana uses 2 fabric and 1 strap..."
    e "普通头巾需要2份布料和1条绑带……"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Shelf_e254de6d:

    # "After looking into the books, you decide you have discovered everything readable."
    "翻过这些书后，你决定自己已经发现了所有能读懂的内容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_b9fb7400:

    # "You run into a chest in the cave, you walk towards it, trying to open it anything possible."
    "你在洞穴里遇到一只箱子，便走上前去，试图将它打开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_4921e600:

    # "You discovered 100 gold, and 2 strength potions inside the chest."
    "你在箱子里发现了100枚金币和2瓶力量药水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_dee24fa2:

    # "You discovered 80 gold, 4 pieces of iron ingot and a recipe for canvas inside the chest."
    "你在箱子里发现了80枚金币、4块铁锭，以及帆布的制作配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_9f2e69f7:

    # e "To make a canvas, you need... 3 hemps and 2 straps, got it."
    e "制作帆布需要……3份麻料和2条绑带，明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_2b03842f:

    # e "Uhm... Kari? You want the stuff inside the chest?"
    e "卡里 你要胸口里的东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_39c62512:

    # k "Keep it, Courier. I just want to save Furk."
    k "留着吧，信使。我只想救 Furk。"

translate schinese_rewrite Damp_Cave_Chest_ceca3aac:

    # e "Alright! Thanks, General."
    e "好的！谢谢你，将军。"
